      "id": "e2a14fe834e9-q1",
      "number": 1,
      "question": "Which of the following battles is considered the formal beginning of the British Raj in India? &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360; &#2354;&#2337;&#2364;&#2366;&#2312; &#2325;&#2379; &#2349;&#2366;&#2352;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2348;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2335;&#2367;&#2358; &#2352;&#2366;&#2332; &#2325;&#2368; &#2324;&#2346;&#2330;&#2366;&#2352;&#2367;&#2325; &#2358;&#2369;&#2352;&#2369;&#2310;&#2340; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Which of the following battles is considered the formal beginning of the British Raj in India? </p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360; &#2354;&#2337;&#2364;&#2366;&#2312; &#2325;&#2379; &#2349;&#2366;&#2352;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2348;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2335;&#2367;&#2358; &#2352;&#2366;&#2332; &#2325;&#2368; &#2324;&#2346;&#2330;&#2366;&#2352;&#2367;&#2325; &#2358;&#2369;&#2352;&#2369;&#2310;&#2340; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "First Carnatic War &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2341;&#2350; &#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2344;&#2366;&#2335;&#2325; &#2351;&#2369;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">First Carnatic War</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2341;&#2350; &#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2344;&#2366;&#2335;&#2325; &#2351;&#2369;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Battle of Plassey &#2346;&#2381;&#2354;&#2366;&#2360;&#2368; &#2325;&#2366; &#2351;&#2369;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Battle of Plassey</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2346;&#2381;&#2354;&#2366;&#2360;&#2368; &#2325;&#2366; &#2351;&#2369;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Battle of Wandiwash &#2357;&#2366;&#2306;&#2337;&#2367;&#2357;&#2366;&#2358; &#2325;&#2368; &#2354;&#2337;&#2364;&#2366;&#2312;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Battle of Wandiwash</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2357;&#2366;&#2306;&#2337;&#2367;&#2357;&#2366;&#2358; &#2325;&#2368; &#2354;&#2337;&#2364;&#2366;&#2312;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Battle of Buxar &#2348;&#2325;&#2381;&#2360;&#2352; &#2325;&#2366; &#2351;&#2369;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Battle of Buxar</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2348;&#2325;&#2381;&#2360;&#2352; &#2325;&#2366; &#2351;&#2369;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343;</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>The Battle of Plassey, fought in 1757 between the British East India Company and the Nawab of Bengal, marked a pivotal moment in Indian history. This battle effectively established British colonial power in India and is widely considered the beginning of British political dominance in the subcontinent.</p>",
