      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "e2a14fe834e9-q2",
      "number": 2,
      "question": "One of the main reasons for the defeat of Nawab Siraj-ud-daulah in the Battle of Plassey was that the forces led by _________, one of his commanders, never fought the battle. &#2346;&#2381;&#2354;&#2366;&#2360;&#2368; &#2325;&#2375; &#2351;&#2369;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2344;&#2357;&#2366;&#2348; &#2360;&#2367;&#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2369;&#2342;&#2381;&#2342;&#2380;&#2354;&#2366; &#2325;&#2368; &#2361;&#2366;&#2352; &#2325;&#2366; &#2319;&#2325; &#2350;&#2369;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351; &#2325;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2351;&#2361; &#2341;&#2366; &#2325;&#2367; &#2313;&#2344;&#2325;&#2375; &#2325;&#2350;&#2366;&#2306;&#2337;&#2352;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2319;&#2325; _________ &#2325;&#2375; &#2344;&#2375;&#2340;&#2371;&#2340;&#2381;&#2357; &#2357;&#2366;&#2354;&#2368; &#2360;&#2375;&#2344;&#2366; &#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2349;&#2368; &#2351;&#2369;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343; &#2344;&#2361;&#2368;&#2306; &#2354;&#2337;&#2364;&#2366;&#2404;",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>One of the main reasons for the defeat of Nawab Siraj-ud-daulah in the Battle of Plassey was that the forces led by _________, one of his commanders, never fought the battle.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2346;&#2381;&#2354;&#2366;&#2360;&#2368; &#2325;&#2375; &#2351;&#2369;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2344;&#2357;&#2366;&#2348; &#2360;&#2367;&#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2369;&#2342;&#2381;&#2342;&#2380;&#2354;&#2366; &#2325;&#2368; &#2361;&#2366;&#2352; &#2325;&#2366; &#2319;&#2325; &#2350;&#2369;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351; &#2325;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2351;&#2361; &#2341;&#2366; &#2325;&#2367; &#2313;&#2344;&#2325;&#2375; &#2325;&#2350;&#2366;&#2306;&#2337;&#2352;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2319;&#2325; _________ &#2325;&#2375; &#2344;&#2375;&#2340;&#2371;&#2340;&#2381;&#2357; &#2357;&#2366;&#2354;&#2368; &#2360;&#2375;&#2344;&#2366; &#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2349;&#2368; &#2351;&#2369;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343; &#2344;&#2361;&#2368;&#2306; &#2354;&#2337;&#2364;&#2366;&#2404;</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Mahabat Khan &#2350;&#2361;&#2366;&#2348;&#2340; &#2326;&#2366;&#2344;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Mahabat Khan</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2350;&#2361;&#2366;&#2348;&#2340; &#2326;&#2366;&#2344;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Mir Jafar &#2350;&#2368;&#2352; &#2332;&#2366;&#2347;&#2364;&#2352;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Mir Jafar</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2350;&#2368;&#2352; &#2332;&#2366;&#2347;&#2364;&#2352;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Mir Khalifa &#2350;&#2368;&#2352; &#2326;&#2354;&#2368;&#2347;&#2366;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Mir Khalifa</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2350;&#2368;&#2352; &#2326;&#2354;&#2368;&#2347;&#2366;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Mir Jumla II &#2350;&#2368;&#2352; &#2332;&#2369;&#2350;&#2354;&#2366; &#2342;&#2381;&#2357;&#2367;&#2340;&#2368;&#2351;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Mir Jumla II</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2350;&#2368;&#2352; &#2332;&#2369;&#2350;&#2354;&#2366; &#2342;&#2381;&#2357;&#2367;&#2340;&#2368;&#2351;</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>In the Battle of Plassey, Nawab Siraj-ud-daulah faced defeat primarily because his commander <b>Mir Jafar</b> betrayed him by not fully engaging in the battle. Mir Jafar's collusion with the British, led by Robert Clive, proved decisive in the outcome of the battle, ultimately resulting in Siraj-ud-daulah's defeat and the establishment of British dominance in Bengal.</p>",
