      "number": 3,
      "question": "Which military officer led the British forces in the Battle of Chinhat fought in 1857? 1857 &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2354;&#2337;&#2364;&#2375; &#2327;&#2319; &#2330;&#2367;&#2344;&#2361;&#2335; &#2325;&#2375; &#2351;&#2369;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360; &#2360;&#2376;&#2344;&#2381;&#2351; &#2309;&#2343;&#2367;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352;&#2368; &#2344;&#2375; &#2348;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2335;&#2367;&#2358; &#2360;&#2375;&#2344;&#2366; &#2325;&#2366; &#2344;&#2375;&#2340;&#2371;&#2340;&#2381;&#2357; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2341;&#2366;?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Which military officer led the British forces in the Battle of Chinhat fought in 1857?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>1857 &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2354;&#2337;&#2364;&#2375; &#2327;&#2319; &#2330;&#2367;&#2344;&#2361;&#2335; &#2325;&#2375; &#2351;&#2369;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360; &#2360;&#2376;&#2344;&#2381;&#2351; &#2309;&#2343;&#2367;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352;&#2368; &#2344;&#2375; &#2348;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2335;&#2367;&#2358; &#2360;&#2375;&#2344;&#2366; &#2325;&#2366; &#2344;&#2375;&#2340;&#2371;&#2340;&#2381;&#2357; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2341;&#2366;?</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Robert Maclagan &#2352;&#2377;&#2348;&#2352;&#2381;&#2335; &#2350;&#2376;&#2325;&#2381;&#2354;&#2375;&#2327;&#2344;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Robert Maclagan</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2352;&#2377;&#2348;&#2352;&#2381;&#2335; &#2350;&#2376;&#2325;&#2381;&#2354;&#2375;&#2327;&#2344;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Henry Lawrence &#2361;&#2375;&#2344;&#2352;&#2368; &#2354;&#2377;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;&#2360;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Henry Lawrence</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2361;&#2375;&#2344;&#2352;&#2368; &#2354;&#2377;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;&#2360;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "James George Smith &#2332;&#2375;&#2350;&#2381;&#2360; &#2332;&#2377;&#2352;&#2381;&#2332; &#2360;&#2381;&#2350;&#2367;&#2341;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">James George Smith</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2332;&#2375;&#2350;&#2381;&#2360; &#2332;&#2377;&#2352;&#2381;&#2332; &#2360;&#2381;&#2350;&#2367;&#2341;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Charles Ellice &#2330;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2354;&#2381;&#2360; &#2319;&#2354;&#2367;&#2360;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Charles Ellice</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2330;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2354;&#2381;&#2360; &#2319;&#2354;&#2367;&#2360;</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p><b>Battle of Chinhat  -  30 June 1857</b></p><p>&#183; <b>Context</b>: The Battle of Chinhat was a significant early clash during the <b>Indian Rebellion of 1857</b>, fought near <b>Lucknow</b>.</p><p>&#183; <b>British Commander</b>: <b>Sir Henry Lawrence</b>, the Chief Commissioner of Oudh (Awadh), led the British forces.</p><p>&#183; <b>Outcome</b>: The British forces <b>suffered a defeat</b> against the rebel forces, which was a major blow early in the revolt. This forced them to retreat to the <b>Residency in Lucknow</b>, leading to the famous <b>Siege of Lucknow</b>.</p>",
