      "number": 4,
      "question": "The Battle of Buxar was fought between the forces under the command of the British East India Company led by Hector Munro, and the combined armies of ________. &#2348;&#2325;&#2381;&#2360;&#2352; &#2325;&#2368; &#2354;&#2337;&#2364;&#2366;&#2312; &#2361;&#2375;&#2325;&#2381;&#2335;&#2352; &#2350;&#2369;&#2344;&#2352;&#2379; &#2325;&#2375; &#2344;&#2375;&#2340;&#2371;&#2340;&#2381;&#2357; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2348;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2335;&#2367;&#2358; &#2312;&#2360;&#2381;&#2335; &#2311;&#2306;&#2337;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2325;&#2306;&#2346;&#2344;&#2368; &#2325;&#2368; &#2325;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2357;&#2366;&#2354;&#2368; &#2360;&#2375;&#2344;&#2366;&#2323;&#2306; &#2324;&#2352; ________ &#2325;&#2368; &#2360;&#2306;&#2351;&#2369;&#2325;&#2381;&#2340; &#2360;&#2375;&#2344;&#2366;&#2323;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2368;&#2330; &#2354;&#2337;&#2364;&#2368; &#2327;&#2312; &#2341;&#2368;&#2404;",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>The Battle of Buxar was fought between the forces under the command of the British East India Company led by Hector Munro, and the combined armies of ________.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2348;&#2325;&#2381;&#2360;&#2352; &#2325;&#2368; &#2354;&#2337;&#2364;&#2366;&#2312; &#2361;&#2375;&#2325;&#2381;&#2335;&#2352; &#2350;&#2369;&#2344;&#2352;&#2379; &#2325;&#2375; &#2344;&#2375;&#2340;&#2371;&#2340;&#2381;&#2357; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2348;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2335;&#2367;&#2358; &#2312;&#2360;&#2381;&#2335; &#2311;&#2306;&#2337;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2325;&#2306;&#2346;&#2344;&#2368; &#2325;&#2368; &#2325;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2357;&#2366;&#2354;&#2368; &#2360;&#2375;&#2344;&#2366;&#2323;&#2306; &#2324;&#2352; ________ &#2325;&#2368; &#2360;&#2306;&#2351;&#2369;&#2325;&#2381;&#2340; &#2360;&#2375;&#2344;&#2366;&#2323;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2368;&#2330; &#2354;&#2337;&#2364;&#2368; &#2327;&#2312; &#2341;&#2368;&#2404;</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Mir jafar, Siraj-ud-Daulah and Mughal Emperor Shah Alam II &#2350;&#2368;&#2352; &#2332;&#2366;&#2347;&#2364;&#2352;, &#2360;&#2367;&#2352;&#2366;&#2332;-&#2313;&#2342;-&#2342;&#2380;&#2354;&#2366; &#2324;&#2352; &#2350;&#2369;&#2327;&#2364;&#2354; &#2360;&#2350;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2335; &#2358;&#2366;&#2361; &#2310;&#2354;&#2350; II",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Mir jafar, Siraj-ud-Daulah and Mughal Emperor Shah Alam II</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2350;&#2368;&#2352; &#2332;&#2366;&#2347;&#2364;&#2352;, &#2360;&#2367;&#2352;&#2366;&#2332;-&#2313;&#2342;-&#2342;&#2380;&#2354;&#2366; &#2324;&#2352; &#2350;&#2369;&#2327;&#2364;&#2354; &#2360;&#2350;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2335; &#2358;&#2366;&#2361; &#2310;&#2354;&#2350; II</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Mir Qasim, Mughal Emperor Shah Alam & Shuja-ud-daulah of Awadh &#2350;&#2368;&#2352; &#2325;&#2366;&#2360;&#2367;&#2350;, &#2350;&#2369;&#2327;&#2354; &#2360;&#2350;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2335; &#2358;&#2366;&#2361; &#2310;&#2354;&#2350; &#2324;&#2352; &#2309;&#2357;&#2343; &#2325;&#2375; &#2358;&#2369;&#2332;&#2366;-&#2313;&#2342;-&#2342;&#2380;&#2354;&#2366;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Mir Qasim, Mughal Emperor Shah Alam &amp; Shuja-ud-daulah of Awadh</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2350;&#2368;&#2352; &#2325;&#2366;&#2360;&#2367;&#2350;, &#2350;&#2369;&#2327;&#2354; &#2360;&#2350;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2335; &#2358;&#2366;&#2361; &#2310;&#2354;&#2350; &#2324;&#2352; &#2309;&#2357;&#2343; &#2325;&#2375; &#2358;&#2369;&#2332;&#2366;-&#2313;&#2342;-&#2342;&#2380;&#2354;&#2366;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Mir Jafar, Mughal Emperor Bahadur Shah II, Shuja-ud-Daulah &#2350;&#2368;&#2352; &#2332;&#2366;&#2347;&#2364;&#2352;, &#2350;&#2369;&#2327;&#2364;&#2354; &#2360;&#2350;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2335; &#2348;&#2361;&#2366;&#2342;&#2369;&#2352; &#2358;&#2366;&#2361; II, &#2358;&#2369;&#2332;&#2366;-&#2313;&#2342;-&#2342;&#2380;&#2354;&#2366;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Mir Jafar, Mughal Emperor Bahadur Shah II, Shuja-ud-Daulah</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2350;&#2368;&#2352; &#2332;&#2366;&#2347;&#2364;&#2352;, &#2350;&#2369;&#2327;&#2364;&#2354; &#2360;&#2350;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2335; &#2348;&#2361;&#2366;&#2342;&#2369;&#2352; &#2358;&#2366;&#2361; II, &#2358;&#2369;&#2332;&#2366;-&#2313;&#2342;-&#2342;&#2380;&#2354;&#2366;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Siraj-ud-Daulah, Shuja-ud-Daulah, Mughal Emperor Shah Alam II &#2360;&#2367;&#2352;&#2366;&#2332;-&#2313;&#2342;-&#2342;&#2380;&#2354;&#2366;, &#2358;&#2369;&#2332;&#2366;-&#2313;&#2342;-&#2342;&#2380;&#2354;&#2366;, &#2350;&#2369;&#2327;&#2354; &#2360;&#2350;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2335; &#2358;&#2366;&#2361; &#2310;&#2354;&#2350; II",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Siraj-ud-Daulah, Shuja-ud-Daulah, Mughal Emperor Shah Alam II</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2360;&#2367;&#2352;&#2366;&#2332;-&#2313;&#2342;-&#2342;&#2380;&#2354;&#2366;, &#2358;&#2369;&#2332;&#2366;-&#2313;&#2342;-&#2342;&#2380;&#2354;&#2366;, &#2350;&#2369;&#2327;&#2354; &#2360;&#2350;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2335; &#2358;&#2366;&#2361; &#2310;&#2354;&#2350; II</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>The Battle of Buxar resulted in the British establishing their rule by defeating the combined army of Mir Qasim, the Nawab of Bengal, the Nawab of Oudh, and the Mughal Emperor, Shah Alam II.</p><p>Hence, option (b) is correct.</p>",
