      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Against whom was the Battle of Plassey (1751) fought by the English Company led by Robert Clive?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2352;&#2377;&#2348;&#2352;&#2381;&#2335; &#2325;&#2381;&#2354;&#2366;&#2311;&#2357; &#2325;&#2375; &#2344;&#2375;&#2340;&#2371;&#2340;&#2381;&#2357; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2309;&#2306;&#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2332;&#2368; &#2325;&#2306;&#2346;&#2344;&#2368; &#2342;&#2381;&#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2366; &#2346;&#2381;&#2354;&#2366;&#2360;&#2368; &#2325;&#2366; &#2351;&#2369;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343; (1751) &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2325;&#2375; &#2357;&#2367;&#2352;&#2369;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343; &#2354;&#2337;&#2364;&#2366; &#2327;&#2351;&#2366; &#2341;&#2366;?</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Nizam of Awadh &#2309;&#2357;&#2343; &#2325;&#2375; &#2344;&#2367;&#2332;&#2364;&#2366;&#2350;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Nizam of Awadh</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2309;&#2357;&#2343; &#2325;&#2375; &#2344;&#2367;&#2332;&#2364;&#2366;&#2350;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Siraj Ud Daulah &#2360;&#2367;&#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2313;&#2342; &#2342;&#2380;&#2354;&#2366;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Siraj Ud Daulah</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2360;&#2367;&#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2313;&#2342; &#2342;&#2380;&#2354;&#2366;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Murshid Quli Khan &#2350;&#2369;&#2352;&#2381;&#2358;&#2368;&#2342; &#2325;&#2369;&#2354;&#2368; &#2326;&#2366;&#2344;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Murshid Quli Khan</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2350;&#2369;&#2352;&#2381;&#2358;&#2368;&#2342; &#2325;&#2369;&#2354;&#2368; &#2326;&#2366;&#2344;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Shaan Nawab &#2358;&#2366;&#2344; &#2344;&#2357;&#2366;&#2348;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Shaan Nawab</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2358;&#2366;&#2344; &#2344;&#2357;&#2366;&#2348;</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>The Battle of Plassey took place between the British East India Company troops, commanded by Robert Clive, and <b>Siraj-ud-Daulah</b>, the last Nawab of Bengal, along with his French allies.</p>",
