      "question": "Who led the English army in the Battle of Buxar? &#2348;&#2325;&#2381;&#2360;&#2352; &#2325;&#2375; &#2351;&#2369;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2309;&#2306;&#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2332;&#2368; &#2360;&#2375;&#2344;&#2366; &#2325;&#2366; &#2344;&#2375;&#2340;&#2371;&#2340;&#2381;&#2357; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2341;&#2366;?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Who led the English army in the Battle of Buxar?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2348;&#2325;&#2381;&#2360;&#2352; &#2325;&#2375; &#2351;&#2369;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2309;&#2306;&#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2332;&#2368; &#2360;&#2375;&#2344;&#2366; &#2325;&#2366; &#2344;&#2375;&#2340;&#2371;&#2340;&#2381;&#2357; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2341;&#2366;?</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Lord Clive &#2354;&#2377;&#2352;&#2381;&#2337; &#2325;&#2381;&#2354;&#2366;&#2311;&#2357;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Lord Clive</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2354;&#2377;&#2352;&#2381;&#2337; &#2325;&#2381;&#2354;&#2366;&#2311;&#2357;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "William Henry Sleeman &#2357;&#2367;&#2354;&#2367;&#2351;&#2350; &#2361;&#2375;&#2344;&#2352;&#2368; &#2360;&#2381;&#2354;&#2368;&#2350;&#2344;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">William Henry Sleeman</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2357;&#2367;&#2354;&#2367;&#2351;&#2350; &#2361;&#2375;&#2344;&#2352;&#2368; &#2360;&#2381;&#2354;&#2368;&#2350;&#2344;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Hector Munro &#2361;&#2375;&#2325;&#2381;&#2335;&#2352; &#2350;&#2369;&#2344;&#2352;&#2379;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Hector Munro</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2361;&#2375;&#2325;&#2381;&#2335;&#2352; &#2350;&#2369;&#2344;&#2352;&#2379;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Charles Eyrecoot &#2330;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2354;&#2381;&#2360; &#2310;&#2351;&#2352;&#2325;&#2370;&#2335;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Charles Eyrecoot</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2330;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2354;&#2381;&#2360; &#2310;&#2351;&#2352;&#2325;&#2370;&#2335;</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>The English army at the Battle of Buxar was led by Major <b>Hector Munro</b>, which took place on October 22, 1764. The battle was a significant conflict during the East India Company's expansion in India and resulted in the victory of the British East India Company forces over a coalition of Indian rulers.</p>",
