      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>In which of the following years did Japan invade India resulting in the Battle of Imphal?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2332;&#2366;&#2346;&#2366;&#2344; &#2344;&#2375; &#2349;&#2366;&#2352;&#2340; &#2346;&#2352; &#2310;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2350;&#2339; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2367;&#2360;&#2325;&#2375; &#2346;&#2352;&#2367;&#2339;&#2366;&#2350;&#2360;&#2381;&#2357;&#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2311;&#2350;&#2381;&#2347;&#2366;&#2354; &#2351;&#2369;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343; &#2358;&#2369;&#2352;&#2370; &#2361;&#2369;&#2310;?</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "1862 1862",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">1862</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1862</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "1944 1944",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">1944</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1944</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "1901 1901",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">1901</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1901</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "1899 1899",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">1899</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1899</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p><b>Battles of Imphal</b> and Kohima</p><p>Fought between 8 March and 18 July 1944, these were the turning point of one of the most gruelling campaigns of the Second World War (1939-45).</p><p>On 7 December 1941, the Japanese attacked the US naval base at Pearl Harbour and later declared war on Britain and the United States.</p>",
