      "id": "e2a14fe834e9-q9",
      "number": 9,
      "question": "In which year was the Battle of Buxar fought? &#2348;&#2325;&#2381;&#2360;&#2352; &#2325;&#2366; &#2351;&#2369;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2354;&#2337;&#2364;&#2366; &#2327;&#2351;&#2366; &#2341;&#2366;?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>In which year was the Battle of Buxar fought?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2348;&#2325;&#2381;&#2360;&#2352; &#2325;&#2366; &#2351;&#2369;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2354;&#2337;&#2364;&#2366; &#2327;&#2351;&#2366; &#2341;&#2366;?</span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "1793 1793",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">1793</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1793</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "1777 1777",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">1777</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1777</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "1764 1764",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">1764</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1764</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "1757 1757",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">1757</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1757</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>&bull; The Battle of Buxar was fought on 22 October 1764 between the British East India Company and the combined forces of:</p><p>o Mir Qasim (Nawab of Bengal)</p><p>o Shuja-ud-Daula (Nawab of Awadh)</p><p>o Mughal Emperor Shah Alam II</p><p>&bull; The battle resulted in a decisive British victory, leading to the Treaty of Allahabad (1765), which gave the Diwani (Revenue collection rights) of Bengal, Bihar, and Orissa to the British.</p><p>&bull; This victory strengthened British control over Eastern India, laying the foundation for British colonial rule in India.</p>",
